// [Claude, 2026-10-03] GENERATED by gen_kodam_round_prm.py (seed 20261003) -- Kodam packing test with a round
// container and one-by-one release; see the generator's docstring for every change relative to prms/DropTest_kodam_packing_gas.prm.
// DropTest_kodam_packing_gas.prm  (auto-generated by gen_kodam_packing_prm.py)
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Local recreation of Kodam et al. (2010) Part II Sec. 3.3 "Static packing in a cylinder":
// 250 cylinders (R=4, L=5.3 LU=mm, L/D=0.6625, matching Kodam's real 8.0/5.3mm exactly),
// dropped in waves of up to 9 (one per reused spawn column) into a square, area-matched stand-in
// for Kodam's real 50.6mm-diameter circular container. friction/restitution taken directly from Kodam's
// Table 1 (0.5/0.85). Gravity and wave timing REUSE THE EXACT PROVEN-STABLE VALUES from the existing
// DropTest_cylinders_250_gas.prm -- see this script's own module docstring for why a faster "demo
// speed" gravity was tried and found to cause the particle count to collapse (contact-model
// instability at the resulting impact velocity), and why strict one-at-a-time release was dropped
// in favour of the already-validated batched-wave schedule. 1 LU = 1 mm.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

